class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Cmd_CommandExecute</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">CmdCommandSource</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Abc_Frame_t_</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">int</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"o\">**</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">19831</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x14b75c8</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">CmdCommandDispatch</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Cmd_CommandExecute</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Abc_RealMain</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">int</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"o\">**</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">21311</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x1618f7e</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.(</span><span class=\"n\">anonymous</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">namespace</span><span class=\"p\">)::</span><span class=\"n\">RunAbcState</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.(</span><span class=\"n\">anonymous</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">namespace</span><span class=\"p\">)::</span><span class=\"n\">AbcPass</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">execute</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Yosys</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Pass</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">call</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Yosys</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">run_pass</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">4355</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x3e41d4</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_start</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x12624</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wasi</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nc\">cli</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"o\">@</span><span class=\"mf\">0.2.3</span><span class=\"p\">#</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"c1\">//wasm/00021de6:wasm-function[51]:0xdba)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>I don't know which adapter version YoWASP's build uses. It is reproducible with the published npm packages above. A downstream workaround exists (passing the commands inline), so this is not urgent for us. Still, the trap and its message look like an adapter bug in the descriptor freelist's bookkeeping when files are opened and closed in this nested pattern.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
